flowchart LR
    A[Agent A\nAgentIdentity\nML-DSA + ML-KEM + X25519] --> B[Agent Card & Discovery\nSigned card\nTrustStore pinning\nChallenge + TTL]
    B --> C[Session handshake\nSigned X25519 hello/ack\nTranscript-bound HKDF\nRotating opaque handles]
    C --> D[Secure channel\nAES-256-GCM\nSequence numbers\nReplay window\nPadding buckets]
    D --> E[Protocol envelope\nML-KEM-768 ciphertext\nML-DSA-65 signature\nAAD + validity window]
    E --> F[Transport boundary\nQUIC / TLS 1.3\nTCP fallback\nMTU fragmentation]
    F --> G[Relay / Rendezvous\nOpaque handle routing\nScoped capability\nBounded queues]
    G --> F
    F --> E
    E --> D
    D --> H[Agent B\nDecrypt + verify\nReplay commit after AEAD]
    H --> I[Operational controls\nDurable replay cache\nAudit + metrics\nKMS/HSM adapter boundary]
    J[Async KEM ratchet\nOne-time token\nBounded skipped state] -. optional stronger session .-> D
    K[Formal model\nTLA+ / TLC\n5 invariants\nFinite-state scope] -. verifies state invariants .-> J

